ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/a/a4/f0fm4dl89v14zev9d2r5y2dpw6b3hdq.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%A5%87%E6%83%B3%E5%85%B1%E9%B8%A3.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/a/a4/f0fm4dl89v14zev9d2r5y2dpw6b3hdq.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />奇想共鸣\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>(被动)[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灵感星核\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">灵感星核</font></span></span>]范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内所有友军，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲物防2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲魔防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲魔防2</font></span></span>]；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">召唤者</span>]行动结束时，若处于范围内，则额外回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"协同响应\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">协同响应</font></span></span>]，效果：[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">召唤者</span>]立即对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灵感星核\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">灵感星核</font></span></span>]造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>魔攻值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]（友军攻击[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"灵感星核\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">灵感星核</font></span></span>]时也可触发本效果），本次伤害拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"共鸣•魔术师\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">共鸣•魔术师</font></span></span>]效果，每回合最多触发2次。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B4%9D%E6%8B%89%E2%80%A2%E9%AD%94%E6%9C%AF%E5%B8%88\" title=\"角色图鉴库/贝拉•魔术师\"><img alt=\"头像 贝拉•魔术师.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/a0hndp63mq5sil1xz7x6f9ro1txplpl.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">贝拉•魔术师</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022143707\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation pa